<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stone Energy, Union Texas cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stone Energy, Union Texas cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Phillip Pace said he downgraded Stone Energy Corp to neutral from outperform due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- He said Stone Energy was a &quot;great company now at a fair value.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He also downgraded Union Texas Petroleum Holdings Inc to neutral from outperform, saying he saw &quot;better growth opportunities elsewhere.&quot;</p>
</text>
